PARITY (web source is THE spec — every t() + render branch reproduced)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Composition : GlassPanel (TSGlassPanel) + header (cyan chevron accent + bold
              "Quick Links" title) + responsive link grid. 6 links, web order:
              Drives / Charging / Battery / Climate / Efficiency / Settings.
Icons       : uniformly text-muted (NO per-item color in the web source — none invented).
              Lucide -> SF Symbol: Route->point.topleft.down.to.point.bottomright.curvepath,
              BatteryCharging->battery.100.bolt, Battery->battery.100,
              Thermometer->thermometer.medium, BarChart3->chart.bar.fill, Settings->gearshape.fill.
Grid        : web grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-6 -> QuickLinksLayout 2/3/6
              at sm=640 / lg=1024 (unit-tested + executed).
Navigation  : web <Link to> -> onSelect(QuickLinkItem) (dependency inversion, host routes).
              Each webPath maps to a REAL AppRoute (no dead tile); AppRouteParser round-trips
              every routePath: /drives->/driving, /charging, /battery->/energy,
              /climate->/vehicle-systems, /efficiency->/analytics, /settings.
i18n keys   : nav.drives, nav.charging, nav.battery, nav.climate, nav.efficiency,
              nav.settings, vehicles.detail.quickLinks  (+ native chrome under
              vehicles.detail.quickLinks.* — every literal resolved via P1/S10 facade).
States      : loading (skeleton grid) · empty (ContentUnavailableView) · error (retry) ·
              content (6-tile grid) · stale/offline (header chip + one-shot auto-refresh on stale).
Seams       : P1/S8 state-holder (QuickLinksCatalogSource + @Observable model, no HTTP in view),
              P1/S11 telemetry (view.opened surface="QuickLinksSection", emitted once),
              P1/S9 design tokens (Color.TS/Font.TS/TSSpacing/TSRadius/TSMotion — no raw hex),
              P1/S10 i18n facade (QuickLinksSectionStrings, table "QuickLinksSection").
A11y        : panel container label, per-tile combined label + "Opens {label}" hint + .isButton,
              decorative icons hidden, header .isHeader, Dynamic Type (Font.TS roles),
              Reduce Motion respected (press style + skeleton shimmer).
Files       : QuickLinksSection.swift / .Adapter.swift / .Model.swift / .Views.swift /
              .Previews.swift / .Tests.swift / .strings  (7 files, one exported view per file).

